yle:normal;font-weight:normal;left:195.01pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:48.85pt">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-212" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:FairValueConcentrationOfRiskCashAndCashEquivalents" scale="6" id="f-852">0.7</ix:nonFraction> million</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:243.86pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:132.36pt">. The discount rates ranged from </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:376.22pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:20.83pt"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="c-213" decimals="INF" name="exod:DiscountRateOfTreasuryBillsHeldToMaturity" scale="-2" id="f-853">1.1</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:397.05pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:12.77pt"> to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:409.82pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:20.83pt"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="c-214" decimals="INF" name="exod:DiscountRateOfTreasuryBillsHeldToMaturity" scale="-2" id="f-854">2.4</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:430.65pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:24.15pt"> as of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:454.8pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:78.54pt">December&#160;31, 2024</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:533.3399999999999pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt">.</span></div><div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:510.8pt;width:612pt"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;left:58.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:265.62pt">Assets and Liabilities Not Measured and Recorded at Fair Value</span></div><div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:532.3pt;width:612pt"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:58.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:494.85pt">The Company&#8217;s financial instruments, including USDC, are carried at cost, which approximates their fair value. If these</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.35pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"> </span></div><div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:543.8pt;width:612pt"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:58.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:494.92pt">financial instruments were recorded at fair value, they would be based on Level 1 inputs. The Company also holds notes</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.4200000000001pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"> </span></div><div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:555.3pt;width:612pt"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:58.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:342.81pt">receivable that are recorded at amortized costs which approximates their fair value. </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:401.31pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:152.17pt">The fair value of these instruments is</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:553.48pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"> </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:566.8pt;width:612pt"><ix:continuation id="f-820-2"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:58.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:463.27pt">not readily determinable due to their non-marketable nature and is therefore not included in the fair value hierarchy.</span></ix:continuation><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:521.77pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.5pt"> </span></div></div></div><div style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #CCCC;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto 10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt;word-wrap:break-word"><div style="position:var(--position);top:747pt"><div style="width:495pt"><div style="line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);top:17.92pt;width:612pt"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:10p